    "nonblocking_notes": [
      "Bonus (tier 11, 20-star gate): rusty_hinge (W10 'Rusty Rides', max_turns 1, the floor of its safe range) + turntable (the Ferris wheel turns the stack every 3 locks) + confetti_fill (W12 'Confetti Cannon'). Two twists and one mechanic, within the cap.",
      "Wacky inversion: you can barely turn your piece, so the ride turns the board for you. Meant to be retried; g0 1.30 is 0.10 below a tier-10 F2 because one turn per piece is the difficulty."
